      "message_parsed": "Простой пример установки/обновление<br />\nПоехали<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">sudo nano /etc/apt/sources.list</pre><pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">deb http://packages.dotdeb.org stable all\n#deb-src http://packages.dotdeb.org stable all\ndeb http://php53.dotdeb.org stable all\n#deb-src http://php53.dotdeb.org stable all</pre>Потом<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"\">apt-get update\napt-get install mysql-server-5.1 mysql-client-5.1\napt-get install php5-cgi\napt-get instal apache2</pre>",
